## Frontend Conventions
- Inter font, Slate neutral palette (#F8FAFC background)
- shadcn/ui components only
- Status colors: green=approved, amber=pending, red=denied, blue=in-progress
- NEVER use red for decorative elements
- font-mono for ALL medical codes (CPT, ICD-10, NDC, PA ref numbers)
- 4px spacing grid — all padding/margin multiples of 4
- text-sm (14px) default body text for clinical data density
- Lucide React for icons only
- Empty states: informative not playful
- Error messages: specific not generic

## DO NOT
- Do not modify files outside current task scope
- Do not add dependencies not listed in the task
- Do not use `any` TypeScript type
- Do not add auth or login screens
- Do not put agent logic in React components
- Do not use method="ReAct" in byLLM calls
- Do not use `let` or `check` keywords in Jac
- Do not use `-->` to connect a new node (use `++>`)
- Keep all Jac files under 500 lines

